  m_text: "\n\n<b>\t\t\t        How to Play</b>\n\nStepping on a safe tile reveals
    a number.\nThe number tells you how many mines are in the adjacent tiles.\nIf
    a tile is blank, there are no mines nearby.\nAvoid mines or lose a life!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
